  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tkyz](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tkyz) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 120.214 depth occurred on Aug 15 2026 17km W of Samban. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -4.411 longitude 143.9212. It impacted 29223 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
